# Known Error Documentation: Memory Exhaustion
 
## Error Title
Memory Exhaustion
 
---
 
## Error ID
KE-MEM-001
 
---
 
## Error Description
OutOfMemoryError
 
---
 
## Root Cause
The application consumed more memory than allocated.
 
---
 
## Resolution
- Increase application memory limits.
- Investigate and fix memory leaks.
- Optimize code to reduce memory usage.
- Restart the application if necessary.
 
